  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Seed multiplication in Tanzania for Dutch seed companies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a DGGF Start-up Loan and a co-financing from the investors, GVA NL B.V. will set up a company in Tanzania to produce seeds for, among other things, tomatoes, cucumbers and onions.The business will create structural employment for around 20 permanent employees, and 20 seasonal workers. All employees will receive extensive training to perform the tasks within the company.</narrative>
  </description>
